acobian matrix is\n\n$$\nJ=\\begin{bmatrix}3-1.8x-4y & -4x \\\\ y & -1+x\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nNext, we evaluate the Jacobian at the equilibrium ${x}^{∗}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$ to get\n\n$$\nJ({x}^{∗})=\\begin{bmatrix}3-1.8(0)-4(0) & -4(0) \\\\ 0 & -1+0\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nThe eigenvalues of the Jacobian matrix are ${\\lambda }_{1}=3\\text{ and }{\\lambda }_{2}=-1.$ Since the eigenvalues are real with opposite signs, our equilibrium is $\\text{an unstable}$ $\\text{saddle}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370425 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370426 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370427 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186370428 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1077 "field-7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186370427 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370424 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "f8765f0e-22b2-5636-ab04-0200c2dfbf11" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370425 #edb/ref 1080 "spiral sink" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370425 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370425 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9c32c689-fe39-563b-8fe4-458134d4052b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370426 #edb/ref 1080 "spiral source" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370426 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370426 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d285e5c4-dc65-5536-9f79-3f681091c6e8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370427 #edb/ref 1080 "saddle" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370427 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370427 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1c972551-9177-53db-ba32-aadf4301d9d9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186370428 #edb/ref 1080 "center" #edb/ref